#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:151 0f09eb08334b49a2b9774a3d15fcf4ad
msgid ""
"During simulator testing it may be useful to enable/disable the RC failsafe "
"by setting :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE <copter:FS_THR_ENABLE>` = 0 and/or simulate "
"an RC failure by setting :ref:`SIM_RC_FAIL <copter:SIM_RC_FAIL>` = 1"
msgstr ""
"在仿真器测试期间，通过将 :ref:`FS_THR_ENABLE <copter:FS_THR_ENABLE>` 设置为 0 来启用/禁用 RC "
"失控保护，以及/或通过将 :ref:`SIM_RC_FAIL <copter:SIM_RC_FAIL>` 设置为 1 来模拟 RC "
"故障，可能会有所帮助。"

