#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:315 efb89a0d8e9d47e1abf1e1f6d16e762f
msgid "Effect on Failsafes"
msgstr "对失控保护的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:317 dccd494be5b64a9ab57caf7d5e504963
msgid ""
"It may be necessary to extend the RC failsafe timeout due to lag and loss of"
" messages on the telemetry link.  This can be done by increasing the "
":ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT <copter:RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` parameter"
msgstr ""
"由于遥测链路的延迟和消息丢失，可能需要延长 RC 失控保护超时时间。可通过增大 :ref:`RC_FS_TIMEOUT "
"<copter:RC_FS_TIMEOUT>` 参数来实现。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:320 f7fb8b3297ab4ed19fddc3beddce363c
msgid "Handling both Regular RC and MAVLink RC input"
msgstr "同时处理普通 RC 与 MAVLink RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:322 4a8846c1dca44e6cb350ac82a80f20ae
msgid ""
"If MAVLink based RC input is sent from the GCS this will generally override "
"the regular RC input.  If the MAVLink RC input stops, ArduPilot falls back "
"to regular RC input within a few seconds.  This timeout is configurable "
"using the :ref:`RC_OVERRIDE_TIME <copter:RC_OVERRIDE_TIME>` parameter."
msgstr ""
"若地面站发送了基于 MAVLink 的 RC 输入，通常会覆盖普通 RC 输入。若 MAVLink RC 输入停止，ArduPilot "
"将在数秒内回退到普通 RC 输入。该超时时间可通过 :ref:`RC_OVERRIDE_TIME <copter:RC_OVERRIDE_TIME>` "
"参数进行配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-rcinput.rst:324 232156bc11394d79860275364b7dda6f
msgid ""
"The \"RC Override Enable\" :ref:`auxiliary switch <copter:common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` can be used to allow a pilot with a regular RC to forcibly "
"disable any MAVLink RC input"
msgstr ""
"「RC 覆盖启用」:ref:`辅助开关 <copter:common-auxiliary-functions>` "
